{"time": 1762781908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998044566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=474404927] 今天的三号会议室外居然罕见地没有叽叽喳喳的同事，门口站着两个防卫科的干员，看见你来才让开身位。"}
{"time": 1762781946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724981931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在冰糖雪梨）"}
{"time": 1762781951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782249699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“利主任，您找我有事？”"}
{"time": 1762781995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840068770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=302962871]（在泰拉大家身上带点感染很正常啦）"}
{"time": 1762782053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955061207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "门內，莱茵生命的十个主任赫然到了四位，克里斯滕总辖坐在主位。你的话回荡在此时安安静静的会议室中。"}
{"time": 1762782110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104880740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={7E1EA7CE-9875-B252-0B3F-C2D191EB2830}.gif,sub_type=1,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-7E1EA7CE9875B2520B3FC2D191EB2830/0,file_size=1147765]"}
{"time": 1762782132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209477903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“。。。。我是，要被开除了吗？”"}
{"time": 1762782211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857981845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“你好，克总..”"}
{"time": 1762782220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262132488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你的上司马利亚姆朝你招招手，表情有些紧绷绷的。一旁的生态科主任缪尔赛斯倒是偷偷笑了一下。坐在对面的则是防卫科主任和看上去很困的多萝西。"}
{"time": 1762782226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268900819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "(\"晚安，克里斯滕\")"}
