{"time": 1762783466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "591621597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "直接愣住，一脸不可思议表示我一个实习大学生也能参加这种项目。"}
