{"time": 1762949650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1311078649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（我将10样必须品上书给缪尔萨斯，竟然不许！）"}
