{"time": 1762954459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422273273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她手一抬，手里的杖轻飘飘地缩了回去，\"想得美，你这只小羊怎么怎么会做白日梦。\""}
{"time": 1762954487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579229258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好了，我看人也到齐了，先分一下各自需求的东西吧。\"她指了指一边码好的箱子"}
{"time": 1762954520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210562704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好不容易缓过来，把自己需要的东西拿走"}
