{"time": 1762954702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676191036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“做好准备吧，我们面对的是极端的自然”"}
{"time": 1762954702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743161570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“也不用现在就穿上防护服吧？这玩意儿又重又热。”"}
