{"time": 1762954850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537737822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（到地方再说）"}
{"time": 1762954890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428366107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说缪尔赛思主任，要是我们任务回来变成感染者了，算工伤吗？”"}
{"time": 1762954926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "802260805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "芭芙娜的箱子里还放着她要求的箭头和弩弦，斯维塔多了一套生存套组，以及备用的刀刃。同样，在阿尔忒弥斯和刻晴的箱子也有相同的东西。"}
{"time": 1762954930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954774225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还有极端的人群”*耸肩，接过物资箱，简单清点一番“我不太想变成感染者，不过保险能让我安稳享半辈子福的话也不是不行”"}
{"time": 1762954954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974005125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "菲拉的盒子就没有多的东西了"}
{"time": 1762954988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546392235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（？？？？？？）"}
{"time": 1762955043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805198266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”不是，无人机呢？我平时外出都配有无人机的啊！“"}
{"time": 1762955044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458865950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“首先我当然不希望各位感染矿石病，不过要是在这次任务中不幸感染，我司会支付相应的补偿。”缪尔赛斯敲了敲多萝西的肩膀。"}
{"time": 1762955045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966487817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只要能收集足够的数据...就算被感染了....”"}
{"time": 1762955085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269270002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“如果任务危险程度过高，我的建议只有撤离”"}
{"time": 1762955087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752078495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=966487817]“刻师傅，还是不要说这种话了，大家都要平安回来。”"}
{"time": 1762955129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507781897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“唔...到我了？”多萝西揉了揉眼睛，“我给各位...准备了些道具，”"}
{"time": 1762955151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779050975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={F9B539AA-22F0-5BA3-9A5D-54EA44813E79}.gif,sub_type=1,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-F9B539AA22F05BA39A5D54EA44813E79/0,file_size=700060]”如果没有无人机的话，瓦塔西“"}
