{"time": 1762959402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710589067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（《黎博利在航空城》"}
{"time": 1762959439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649779173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟随着机器人，你们来到了舰桥。舰桥有着巨大的防爆门，随着警报声响起，巨大的防爆门打开了，一个可以说是异端的舰桥出现在了你们眼前。这个舰桥和你们以前见过的都不一样，你们脚下的地板明显不是玻璃做的，但却拥有和玻璃一样甚至更高的透明度，下面是错综复杂的电线和服务器机柜。这似乎是一种复合树脂。在这下面的是莱茵生命上个月刚刚设计出来的研究辅助计算系统。你们环顾四周，似\n乎整个舰桥被一个巨大的玻璃罩就这么随意的罩住了。"}
{"time": 1762959457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827166981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“你好？”"}
{"time": 1762959462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448689563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*尝试打招呼"}
{"time": 1762959473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974784873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "麦哲伦独自一人坐在舰桥中间的座位上，拿着一个杯子，似乎在放松。她的手里捏着一根马克笔，面前的桌子上乱糟糟的，但上面除了白纸以外，只随便摆放着一台终端。"}
{"time": 1762959476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767831525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“麦麦麦麦？”"}
{"time": 1762959505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413470423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={08990BAF-286F-0B1A-BB37-D566BEEA6760}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-08990BAF286F0B1ABB37D566BEEA6760/0,file_size=308582]"}
{"time": 1762959580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134190446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“我们是莱茵生命派遣的特勤队”"}
{"time": 1762959592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019119785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“前辈好...”"}
{"time": 1762959593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814661114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“我叫做阿尔忒弥斯”"}
{"time": 1762959603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705003877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“菲拉？”听到你的话她才回过头，把手里的马克笔扔到一边，“虽然是你带队，我有些意外。”"}
{"time": 1762959604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184521160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（这像是坐在塑料椅子上的boss）"}
{"time": 1762959646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1222168574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“这不是两年没见你了，顺便过来看看你嘛”"}
{"time": 1762959664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170324016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不过你们可算是来了。”她打个哈欠，从椅子上站起身，“少来，我每个月都有给你送东西。”"}
{"time": 1762959666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266876195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "（漂亮的无视）"}
{"time": 1762959675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112277504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "（小团体）"}
{"time": 1762959685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895607064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（东西呢？无人机呢？）"}
{"time": 1762959778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874594816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "“我们还是说正式吧，后面这四位都是我们莱茵的经营干员。”"}
