{"time": 1763038148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188054320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“我们还是需要评估一下”"}
{"time": 1763038165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951480887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“进度就算缓慢也要优先保证安全”"}
{"time": 1763038247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485396173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然我这边想尽快，不过确实急不来。\"她开口，\"龙腾，中继器送一个过来。\""}
{"time": 1763038259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639465086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我都行。要咖啡吗站长？”*从包里拿出速溶咖啡“现在也能算进口货了”"}
{"time": 1763038314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196111846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"收到。\"冰冷的ai音回答了她。\n\"哦...咖啡...\"她伸手接过，\"在这边可算紧俏了。\""}
{"time": 1763038326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265481564", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么牌子的，雀巢目前)"}
