{"time": 1763038762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140490351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "”有食用手册吗，遇到特别情况我可以手动激活？“"}
{"time": 1763038824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262680971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"倒是可以了...会无人机相关的话可以试一试，不过我这边不一定能接到信号。\""}
{"time": 1763038827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837879509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“食用手册吗，那很美味了。”"}
{"time": 1763038867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866561098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过说到这个，我觉得我们可以先吃顿热饭，然后再去探索遗迹。”"}
{"time": 1763038927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187167994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“趁着现在这个环境先好好恢复一下体力吧，不然接下来几天可能不会太好受。”"}
{"time": 1763038929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107143663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“可以是可以，但我不觉得这里是有厨师的”"}
{"time": 1763038931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438501671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可不能吃。\"她点点头，\"下了舰桥，生活区就在右边。各位可以明天稍早的时候出发，我想主任应该也和各位说了安排。\""}
{"time": 1763038989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68803974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那接下来这会做什么？天黑得快也没这么快吧”"}
