{"time": 1763043156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230168279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*抓着齿兽的尾巴，用弩箭补刀之后拖着往回走"}
{"time": 1763043242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1773010649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这猎物比我小时候还难对付，难道是因为遗迹的缘故变异了？”"}
{"time": 1763043307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952378375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "它们身上看上去也没有什么矿石病的迹象"}
