{"time": 1763045115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384619185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我只能说这次狩猎很不对劲，萨米不可能有这么强的齿兽。”"}
{"time": 1763045135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789574752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1021302580", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（可能是幕后有啥比操作的）"}
